      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُكَاثٌ</span></b>  <i>Pustules which come forth in the mouths
of camels:</i> (K:) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُكَاثٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A
disease in the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَكَفَتَانِ</span> <i>of a camel, which are two
prominent bones by the fat parts of the two ears:</i>
it is also called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُكَافٌ</span>. (TA.)

